data: {"id": "8b394cb01de540b7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1362", "run_id": "8b394cb01de540b7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "以下是针对 **aiops-case-v13/workload** 已采集的关键事实、冲突点与缺口：\n\n### 1. 已确认的关键事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|---|---|\n| **Pod 生命周期 (YAML/Describe)** | Pod 当前**仍存在**，`phase=Running`，`metadata.deletionTimestamp=2026-09-14T08:24:38Z`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds=3900`（65 分钟），`metadata.finalizers=<none>`。**没有 finalizer 阻塞。** |\n| **Pod 状态** | `kubectl get pod` 返回 `Running`，`kubectl describe` 显示 `status: Terminating (lasts <invalid>)`，说明 kube-apiserver 标记了删除但 kubelet 端容器仍为 Running。 |\n| **Kubelet 事件** | `Stopping container app", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789370437620, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

